  "correct": "3",
  "solution": "[IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/ebadc30a979bf1a7e953d20901c3e7953c575296c0e0bb4af8a458ec3a64ab2c.png] \n\n**Given equation :** 200 * 2 * 10 * 8 * 40 * 20\n\nAccording to the question, after replacing '*' with mathematical signs:\n\nSo,\n\n__\n \n• Option - (1) : ×, =, ÷, +, −\n\n200 * 2 * 10 * 8 * 40 * 20 ⇒ **200 × 2**__ = __**10 ÷ 8**__ + 40 − 20\n\n400 = __**1.25 **____**+ 40**__ − 20\n\n400 = __**41.25 - 20**__\n\n400 ≠ 21.25 (LHS ≠ RHS)\n\n__\n \n• Option - (2) : ×, +, =, ÷, −\n\n200 * 2 * 10 * 8 * 40 * 20 ⇒ **200 × 2**__ + 10 = __**8 ÷ 40**__ − 20\n\n__**400 + 10**__ = __**0.2 - 20**__\n\n410 ≠ -19.8 (LHS ≠ RHS)\n\n__\n \n• Option - (3) : ÷, =, ×, +, −\n\n200 * 2 * 10 * 8 * 40 * 20 ⇒ **200 ÷ 2**__ = __**10 × 8**__ + 40 − 20\n\n100 = __**80 + 40**__ - 20\n\n100 = __**120 - 20**__\n\n**100 = 100 (LHS = RHS)**\n\n__\n \n• Option - (4) : −, +, ÷, =, × \n\n200 * 2 * 10 * 8 * 40 * 20 ⇒ 200 − 2 + **10 ÷ 8**__ = __**40 × 20**__\n\n__**200 + 1.25**__ - 2 = 800\n\n__**201.25 - 2**__ = 800\n\n199.25 ≠ 800 (LHS ≠ RHS)\n\nHence, \"Option - (3)\" is the correct answer.",
